## Where Deployment Names Live (All Must Match)

When changing a deployment name, update ALL of these locations:

| # | Location | File |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Env var default | `backend/app/config/_settings.py` |
| 2 | Canary config | `backend/app/config/canaries.py` |
| 3 | Bridge default | `backend/app/websocket/bridge_server.py` |
| 4 | Azure bridge default | `backend/app/services/azure_bridge.py` |
| 5 | Model stability pinned | `backend/app/services/model_stability.py` |
| 6 | AI pipeline auditor | `backend/app/services/ai_pipeline_auditor.py` |
| 7 | Call coaching engine | `backend/app/services/call_coaching_engine.py` |
| 8 | Insight engine comment | `backend/app/services/insight_engine.py` |
| 9 | Chat deployment defaults | `document_organizer.py`, `ai_modes.py`, `visual_biometric_extractor.py` |
| 10 | `.env.template` | Root |
| 11 | Production `.env` | `/opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/.env` on server |
| 12 | Cursor rules | `trust-100-percent.mdc`, `deployment-trust-100-percent.mdc` |

